  "GuidePages": [
    {
      "Path": "assets/tfc/patchouli_books/field_guide/zh_cn/entries/farming_plus/crops.json",
      "Name": "rhubarb",
      "Locale": "zh_cn",
      "Text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): -12°C - 24°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)湿度$(): 45 - 85 %$(br)$(bold)类别$(): 可采摘蔬菜$(br2)$(bold)$(3)氮$(): 50 $(bold)$(6)磷$(): 20 $(bold)$(d)钾$(): 30$()$(br2)大黄是$(thing)可采摘蔬菜$()。叶柄是食材，叶片不用于食用。$(br2)种子播在$(l:tfc:food/farmland)农田$()上，生长后期空手右键采摘可保留植株；左键破坏会拔除植株。$(br2)叶柄可直接食用或用于原生汤、沙拉和三明治；使用未腐烂原料。"
    },
    {
      "Path": "assets/tfc/patchouli_books/field_guide/zh_cn/entries/farming_plus/crops.json",
      "Name": "sunflower",
      "Locale": "zh_cn",
      "Text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): 5°C - 30°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)湿度$(): 20 - 70 %$(br)$(bold)类别$(): 蔬菜类$(br2)$(bold)$(3)氮$(): 80 $(bold)$(6)磷$(): +30 $(bold)$(d)钾$(): +40$()$(br2)向日葵是双格作物。收获食用葵花籽，播种种子单独保留。$(br2)种子播在$(l:tfc:food/farmland)农田$()上，上方留空供植株长高。完全成熟后破坏任意半株收获并返种，只结算一次。$(br2)食用籽可直接食用或用于原生餐食；当前没有专属榨油配方。"
    },
    {
      "Path": "assets/tfc/patchouli_books/field_guide/zh_cn/entries/farming_plus/crops.json",
      "Name": "agave",
      "Locale": "zh_cn",
      "Text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): 12°C - 40°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)湿度$(): 5 - 45 %$(br)$(bold)类别$(): 蔬菜类$(br2)$(bold)$(3)氮$(): 30 $(bold)$(6)磷$(): 20 $(bold)$(d)钾$(): 50$()$(br2)种子（侧芽）播在$(l:tfc:food/farmland)农田$()上。莲座分六龄生长，完全成熟并显现中心结果态后，破坏整株采收并返还1至2份侧芽；空手右键不采摘。枯死时在原地返还1份对应侧芽，应及时拾取；之后破坏共享死株不再掉落。$(br2)食材是龙舌兰心，侧芽用于播种。当前没有专属烤制或榨汁配方。"
    },
    {
      "Path": "assets/tfc/patchouli_books/field_guide/en_us/entries/farming_plus/crops.json",
      "Name": "rhubarb",
      "Locale": "en_us",
      "Text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)Temperature$(): -12°C - 24°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)Hydration$(): 45 - 85 %$(br)$(bold)Category$(): Pickable Vegetable$(br2)$(bold)$(3)Nitrogen$(): 50 $(bold)$(6)Phosphorous$(): 20 $(bold)$(d)Potassium$(): 30$()$(br2)Rhubarb is a $(thing)pickable vegetable$(): the stalks are food, while leaves are not harvested as food.$(br2)Its seeds are sown on $(l:tfc:food/farmland)farmland$(); late in growth, right-click with an empty hand to harvest and regrow; breaking removes it.$(br2)Eat the stalks or use them in native soup, salads and sandwiches; use unrotten ingredients."
    },
    {
      "Path": "assets/tfc/patchouli_books/field_guide/en_us/entries/farming_plus/crops.json",
      "Name": "sunflower",
      "Locale": "en_us",
      "Text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)Temperature$(): 5°C - 30°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)Hydration$(): 20 - 70 %$(br)$(bold)Category$(): Vegetable$(br2)$(bold)$(3)Nitrogen$(): 80 $(bold)$(6)Phosphorous$(): +30 $(bold)$(d)Potassium$(): +40$()$(br2)Sunflower is a two-block crop: harvests edible sunflower seeds, separate from seeds used for planting.$(br2)Sow on $(l:tfc:food/farmland)farmland$() with space above for the upper plant. Once fully grown, break either half to harvest and return seeds once.$(br2)Eat the food seeds or use them in native meals. Dedicated oil extraction is not connected."
    },
    {
      "Path": "assets/tfc/patchouli_books/field_guide/en_us/entries/farming_plus/crops.json",
      "Name": "agave",
      "Locale": "en_us",
      "Text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)Temperature$(): 12°C - 40°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)Hydration$(): 5 - 45 %$(br)$(bold)Category$(): Vegetable$(br2)$(bold)$(3)Nitrogen$(): 30 $(bold)$(6)Phosphorous$(): 20 $(bold)$(d)Potassium$(): 50$()$(br2)Sow seeds (sidebuds) on $(l:tfc:food/farmland)farmland$(). This rosette has six leaf stages. Once fully grown with a ripe centre, break the whole plant to harvest and receive one to two sidebuds; an empty-hand right-click does not harvest. When it dies, one species sidebud drops immediately: collect it promptly. Breaking the shared dead plant gives nothing further.$(br2)The harvested food is the agave heart; sidebuds are for planting. No dedicated roasting or juice recipe is connected."
