      "Text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): -5°C - 26°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)湿度$(): 40 - 80 %$(br)$(bold)类别$(): 蔬菜类$(br2)$(bold)$(3)氮$(): 60 $(bold)$(6)磷$(): 20 $(bold)$(d)钾$(): 40$()$(br2)牛皮菜是单格作物。叶柄肥厚、叶片宽大；成熟后破坏整株收获，之后需要重新播种。$(br2)牛皮菜种子可以种植在$(l:tfc:food/farmland)农田$()上，成熟后收割可以得到$(thing)牛皮菜$()和$(thing)牛皮菜种子$()。$(br2)"
    },
    {
      "Path": "assets/tfc/patchouli_books/field_guide/en_us/entries/farming_plus/crops.json",
      "Name": "swiss_chard",
      "Locale": "en_us",
      "Text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)Temperature$(): -5°C - 26°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)Hydration$(): 40 - 80 %$(br)$(bold)Category$(): Vegetable$(br2)$(bold)$(3)Nitrogen$(): 60 $(bold)$(6)Phosphorous$(): 20 $(bold)$(d)Potassium$(): 40$()$(br2)Swiss Chard is a single block crop: thick stalks and broad leaves; break the mature plant to harvest, then sow seeds again.$(br2)Swiss Chard seeds can be planted on $(l:tfc:food/farmland)farmland$(), and once ripe the harvest gives $(thing)Swiss Chard$() and $(thing)Swiss Chard Seeds$().$(br2)"
